  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="closing__cta close--type">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2 id="close-h">Keep score at your next game night</h2>
        <p class="t-small muted">Sign up with an email and a password, then add your first game.</p>
      </div>
      <a class="btn btn--primary btn--xl btn--wide" href="/auth/register">Create an account<svg class="m-arrow" viewBox="0 0 12 12" aria-hidden="true"><path class="m-arrow__stem" d="M1 6h8"/><path class="m-arrow__head" d="M4.5 2.5 8 6l-3.5 3.5"/></svg></a>
    </div>
    <div class="closing__links">
      <div class="grid">
        <div class="span-4 stack-4">
          <a class="nav__logo" href="#top"><svg class="logo-keep" width="22" height="24" viewBox="0 0 256 283" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path fill="currentColor" d="M234.667 54.84L149.333 5.646a43.6 43.6 0 0 0-42.917 0L21.082 54.84C5.522 63.624 0 76.675 0 91.984v98.636c0 15.31 8.031 29.364 21.333 37.145l85.334 49.192a43.6 43.6 0 0 0 42.917 0l85.083-49.192C247.969 220.235 256 205.929 256 190.62V91.984c0-15.31-8.031-29.364-21.333-37.145m-57.224 158.368c0 2.510-1.757 4.267-4.016 4.267H82.824c-2.51 0-4.267-1.757-4.267-4.267v-18.573c0-2.259.753-4.266 2.51-6.023l10.792-10.541l6.525-60.738c.251-1.757-.502-3.262-1.757-4.266l-8.784-7.78c-1.757-1.507-2.51-3.765-2.51-6.024V69.647c0-2.51 1.757-4.518 4.267-4.518h13.302c2.259 0 4.518 2.008 4.518 4.267v6.777h11.043v-6.526a4.5 4.5 0 0 1 4.517-4.518h10.793c2.258 0 4.015 2.008 4.015 4.267v6.777h11.043v-6.275c0-2.51 2.51-4.769 5.020-4.769h13.051c2.259 0 4.769 2.008 4.769 4.267v30.62c0 2.008-1.004 3.764-2.26 5.27l-9.536 7.78c-1.255 1.005-1.757 2.51-1.757 4.016l6.776 60.989l10.792 11.043c1.255 1.255 1.757 2.76 1.757 4.517zm-49.192-63.75c-7.027-.25-12.549 6.024-12.549 12.8v26.103c0 1.506 1.255 2.76 2.76 2.76h18.824c1.506 0 3.012-1.505 3.012-3.011v-25.851c-.25-6.777-5.02-12.55-12.047-12.8"/></svg><span class="brand__name">The Keep<span class="brand__desc">board game score keeper</span></span></a>
          <p class="footer__lede">Score keeping for board game groups: rounds, totals, winners and standings.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="span-2 start-7 footer__col"><h3>App</h3><ul><li><a href="#scoreboard">Scoreboard</a></li><li><a href="#scoring">Scoring</a></li><li><a href="#table">Sync</a></li></ul></div>
        <div class="span-2 footer__col"><h3>Help</h3><ul><li><a href="#faq">Questions</a></li><li><a href="/auth/login">Sign in</a></li></ul></div>
      </div>
      <div class="footer__legal">
        <span>&copy; 2026 The Keep · Game names are trademarks of their owners</span>
        <div class="socials"></div>
        <a class="credits" href="/assets/img/credits.json">Photographs via Wikimedia Commons</a>
